<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>pc-tweaker</id>
    <version>1.18.15</version>
    <title>PC Tweaker</title>
    <authors>Aurelio Avila</authors>
    <owners>AurelioAvila</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app/blob/HEAD/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://pctweaker.app/</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app@master/src-tauri/icons/128x128.png</iconUrl>
    <description>PC Tweaker is a Windows 10/11 tuning and maintenance application. It brings inspectable system settings, editable profiles, hardware readings and selected cleanup tools into one interface.

Review each change before applying it. Supported settings save their original values for restoration; cleanup and repair operations have different recovery limits. Performance results depend on the hardware and workload, and no universal FPS increase is promised.

The free tier includes core tweaks and selected monitoring tools. Optional paid plans add advanced tools. Check the official website and checkout for current features, pricing and terms.

The official Windows installer is digitally signed by Aurelio Avila and timestamped. The source repository is available for inspection under a proprietary, source-available license, not an OSI-approved open-source license.

Package notes: since 1.18.8 this package runs the same signed setup as winget and the in-app updater, installed for the user who runs Chocolatey in %LocalAppData%\PC Tweaker. Earlier versions of this package used the MSI.</description>
    <summary>Windows tuning and maintenance with inspectable, restorable settings</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app/releases/tag/v1.18.15</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>2026 Aurelio Avila</copyright>
    <tags>pc-tweaker windows tuning optimization privacy gaming performance tweak admin</tags>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app</projectSourceUrl>
    <packageSourceUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app/tree/master/packaging/chocolatey</packageSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://pctweaker.app/support/</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
